# AdPilot Database Migrations

AdPilot uses Alembic to manage database schema changes.

## Check current migration revision

    alembic current

## Apply migrations

    alembic upgrade head

## Show migration history

    alembic history

## Check for model changes without a migration

    alembic check

## Create a new migration

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe the schema change"

Review autogenerated migrations before applying them.

## Fresh database setup

For a new database, configure DATABASE_URL and run:

    alembic upgrade head

Do not use Base.metadata.create_all as a substitute for production migrations.

Always back up an existing database before applying migrations.
